---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/brandon-portrait.jpg';
import { culture, cultureCos, celebrityFounders, interests, person } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="The story behind Brandon M. Weaver: Los Angeles, Diageo in Cape Town, Bonotel, Sonder, Lacure and Aperture Hospitality.">
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--accent">About</p>
        <h1 class="display">Many Rooms, One <em>Frequency</em>.</h1>
      </div>
      <figure class="photo">
        <Image src={portrait} alt="Brandon M. Weaver" widths={[360, 560]} sizes="(min-width: 900px) 28vw, 70vw" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container rail">
      <div class="rail__head">
        <span class="eyebrow">The story</span>
      </div>
      <div class="prose essay">
        <p class="lede">I’ve spent much of my life trying to answer a simple question: how do you build something that truly matters?</p>
        <p>Growing up in Los Angeles, I was surrounded by people who had already achieved success. The expected path was medicine, education or another respected profession. I chose a different route.</p>
        <p>That route ran from USC’s Annenberg School to a joint degree at Harvard Kennedy School and Northwestern’s Kellogg School of Management, with an MBA internship on Dom Pérignon at Moët Hennessy along the way. Each challenged me to think differently. Together they reinforced a belief that has shaped my career: meaningful growth happens at the intersection of people, ideas and opportunity.</p>
        <p>My career has taken me across industries, continents and cultures. At Diageo I led the Reserve luxury portfolio across Africa from Cape Town and launched two Captain Morgan innovations in the U.S. At Bonotel I was COO through the company’s sale to Certares. At Sonder I built California from a team of one. At Lacure I ran a 65-person commercial organization across 45 countries. Along the way I learned that commerce and community are not opposites. They are in constant negotiation, and the best builders are fluent in both.</p>
        <p>The thread running through all of it isn’t the résumé. It’s the relationships. I move through rooms not as the loudest voice but as the most connected one. I build relationship capital the way others build financial capital: deliberately, generously and with a long time horizon.</p>
        <p>The momentum that comes from human connection lets me be as comfortable in a boardroom as I am sharing a lesson with a stranger. Modern leadership, to me, is about helping others believe they can transform their own reality.</p>
        <p class="bio-link"><a class="link" href={person.execBio} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download the Executive Bio (PDF)</a></p>
        <p class="pull">Success Moves at the Speed of Connectivity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container rail">
      <div class="rail__head"><span class="eyebrow">Brands × culture</span></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Through Diageo, Stillhouse Spirits and BLKBOX, I’ve built brand programs with artists and the industry around them, and I’ve worked on brands built and fronted by celebrity founders and ambassadors. Music and talent are how brands earn attention they can’t buy.</p>
        <p class="tags__label label">Artists</p>
        <ul class="tags">{culture.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}</ul>
        <p class="tags__label label">Celebrity Founders & Ambassadors</p>
        <ul class="tags">{celebrityFounders.map((c) => <li>{c.name} <span class="tags__brand">· {c.brand}</span></li>)}</ul>
        <p class="tags__label label">Music & Media</p>
        <ul class="tags tags--quiet">{cultureCos.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container rail">
      <div class="rail__head"><span class="eyebrow">Off the clock</span></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <ul class="tags">{interests.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}</ul>
        <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="link" href={person.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Say hello on LinkedIn</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-head { padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .head { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: end; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .head { grid-template-columns: 8fr 4fr; gap: 4rem; } }
  .head .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .photo { margin: 0; background: #efefef; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; overflow: hidden; max-width: 380px; border-radius: 2px; }
  .photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 12%; }
  .essay p { font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .essay .lede { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .pull { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem) !important; line-height: 1.25 !important; color: var(--accent) !important; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 2.5rem; padding-top: 1.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .bio-link { margin: 1.75rem 0 0; }
  .tags { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.25rem 0 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem; }
  .tags li { padding: .45rem .9rem; border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 999px; font-size: .9375rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .tags__label { margin: 1.75rem 0 0; }
  .tags__brand { color: var(--ink-3); }
  .tags--quiet li { border-color: var(--rule); color: var(--ink-2); }
</style>
